A||N||2||Elenor84||Cam shafts||||1||
Z||000000||Elenor84||01-26-2001||02:29 AM||||I'm in a big argument with my friend right now...do 2.5 litre iron dukes have cam shafts or not?  Someone told me that they don't...who do I believe?<P>------------------<BR>Lance||||reg||1
Z||000001||Oreif||01-26-2001||02:36 AM||||The 2.5L has a camshaft. It's in the engine block and pushes the lifters which then push long rods to the rocker arms in order to open the valves. The 2.5L is not an overhead cam engine.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Elenor84||01-26-2001||02:39 AM||||Arlight, thank you very much!<P>------------------<BR>Lance||||reg||1
